# ── Personal data — NEVER COMMIT ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The PWD masterlist is sensitive personal information under RA 10173: real
# names, birthdates, contact numbers and disability type for residents of
# Barangay New Pandan, including minors. It stays on the local machine and in
# the local database only. Database dumps are excluded for the same reason —
# they contain every seeded row.
server/prisma/data/
server/prisma/*.sql
*.masterlist.txt
PWD_Masterlist*.txt
PWD_Masterlist*.pdf
